---
// ScannerCTA.astro
---
<section id="foco-section" class="py-24 px-4">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    
    <div class="bg-deep rounded-3xl p-10 md:p-16 text-center text-white shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
      <!-- Decoración sutil -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-teal-900/40 via-deep to-deep z-0"></div>
      
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">¿Qué te frena hoy?</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Responde 4 preguntas y obtén un diagnóstico personalizado de tu fricción operativa.
        </p>
        
        <button 
          onclick="document.getElementById('selector-overlay').classList.remove('hidden')"
          class="inline-block bg-orange hover:bg-orange/90 text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold text-lg transition-all shadow-xl hover:scale-105"
        >
          ⚡ Enciende tu Foco Ahora
        </button>
        
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-6 uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">
          Perfil → Dolor → Acción
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>